<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Oppenheimer cuts Allegiance.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Oppenheimer cuts Allegiance.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer analyst John Calcagnini said he cut his rating on Allegiance Corp to market perform from buy due to price.</p>
<p>-- Calcagnini said Allegiance's long-term outlook remains &quot;very favorable.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Allegiance was off 1-3/8 to 24 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
